  "text": "Red Etin is a British folkloric figure. He is an ogre with three heads and an ugly look, yet he was friendly. Cattle dominated his attention. His own herds were creatures of the Otherworld, often with red-coloured ears that marked the fairy people. He guarded the herds of others without a fee. He may trace back to an Otherworld guardian. One Scottish tale shows him as an Irish giant.",
